 ball stage (234–240°F or 112–115°C).","sourceText":"In a saucepan, cook the brown sugar, butter, cinnamon, and dark corn syrup until it reaches the soft ball stage (234–240°F or 112–115°C).","durationMinutes":null},{"n":7,"text":"Stir in ground hazelnuts at this point, if using.","sourceText":"Stir in ground hazelnuts at this point, if using.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":8,"text":"Cut each waffle into two thin layers and sandwich them with some filling.","sourceText":"Cut each waffle into two thin layers and sandwich them with some filling.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":9,"text":"Repeat this process until all the filling and waffles are used.","sourceText":"Repeat this process until all the filling and waffles are used.","durationMinutes":null}],"nutrition":null,"gaps":["Research extraction only; no culinary/editorial review.","Ingredient quantities, units, alternatives, food identities, aggregate duration, and nutrition remain unknown until individually parsed/reviewed.","Source-level CC BY-SA policy applies generally; page-specific exceptions have not been checked."]}},"parsedRecipe":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"wikibooks:263046","recordId":"wikibooks-263046-r4515339","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceRevision":"4515339","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Stroopwafels&oldid=4515339","sourceSha256":"2b2077164c06a744c90f627df338813619e705f02a824b77ce605b8660155964","parserVersion":"wikibooks-sections-v3","quantityParserVersion":"source-prefix-v2","license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are ex